    ibco:sourceNode ibc:ibc2021-1108.5.2 ;
    ibco:statementType "obligation" ;
    ibco:text "1108.5.2 Group I-2 nursing homes. Accessible units and Type B units shall be provided in nursing homes of Group I-2, Condition 1 occupancies in accordance with Sections 1108.5.2.1 and 1108.5.2.2." .

